df3f8f,2900df3fb4,;"Zrušit";cancel,32,V400fb4a8a,2c00fb4ab2,;"Abbrechen";cancel,33,V400df428b,2b00df42b2,;"Cancelar";cancel,34,V400d83e74,2b00d83e9b,;"Cancelar";cancel,35,V400de417e,2800de41a2,;"Mégse";cancel,36,V400f649c2,2a00f649e8,;"Annulla";cancel,37,V400f53910,2800f53934,;"キャンセル";cancel,38,V400f94cb4,2b00f94cdb,;"გაუქმება";cancel,39,V401003c53,2501003c74,;"취소";cancel,40,V400de40ed,2c00de4115,;"Annuleren";cancel,41,V400df406c,2900df4091,;"Anuluj";cancel,42,V400df4121,2b00df4148,;"Cancelar";cancel,43,V400f246c2,2b00f246e9,;"Anulează";cancel,44,V400e24181,2900e241a6,;"Отмена";cancel,45,V400f246b5,2800f246d9,;"İptal";cancel,46,V400df409e,2c00df40c6,;"Скасувати";cancel,47,V400ed4182,2600ed41a4,;"Huỷ";cancel,48,V400de2f25,2500de2f46,;"取消";cancel,49,V400de2f2f,2500de2f50,;"取消";reset_settings_discard_pending,29,V4024db474,83024db4f3,;"Resetting settings will discard your unsaved settings changes. Continue?";reset_settings_discard_pending,30,V40248ac59,810248acd6,;"إعادة تعيين الإعدادات ستُلغي التغييرات غير المحفوظة. هل تريد المتابعة؟";reset_settings_discard_pending,31,V40248b8d9,710248b946,;"Obnovení nastavení zahodí neuložené změny. Pokračovat?";reset_settings_discard_pending,32,V40254c1a2,840254c222,;"Beim Zurücksetzen werden ungespeicherte Änderungen verworfen. Fortfahren?";reset_settings_discard_pending,33,V40245bde4,870245be67,;"Restablecer la configuración descartará los cambios sin guardar. ¿Continuar?";reset_settings_discard_pending,34,V4023db5c3,82023db641,;"Restablecer los ajustes descartará los cambios sin guardar. ¿Continuar?";reset_settings_discard_pending,35,V40241bcf3,890241bd78,;"A beállítások visszaállítása eldobja a nem mentett változtatásokat. Folytatja?";reset_settings_discard_pending,36,V4024fc0a0,8b024fc127,;"Il ripristino delle impostazioni eliminerà le modifiche non salvate. Continuare?";reset_settings_discard_pending,37,V4025093b6,5b0250940d,;"設定をリセットすると、未保存の変更が破棄されます。続行しますか?";reset_settings_discard_pending,38,V4015e6f67,81015e6fe4,;"პარამეტრების ჩამოყრა გააუქმებს თქვენს შეუნახავ ცვლილებებს. გაგრძელდეს?";reset_settings_discard_pending,39,V4016a5633,67016a5696,;"설정을 초기화하면 저장되지 않은 설정 변경 사항이 취소됩니다. 계속하시겠습니까?";reset_settings_discard_pending,40,V40248bd9c,920248be2a,;"Het herstellen van de instellingen verwijdert je niet-opgeslagen wijzigingen. Doorgaan?";reset_settings_discard_pending,41,V40249bcee,870249bd71,;"Przywrócenie ustawień spowoduje odrzucenie niezapisanych zmian. Kontynuować?";reset_settings_discard_pending,42,V40249be39,870249bebc,;"Redefinir as configurações descartará suas alterações não salvas. Continuar?";reset_settings_discard_pending,43,V40249bdac,7b0249be23,;"Resetarea setărilor va anula modificările nesalvate. Continuați?";reset_settings_discard_pending,44,V4024bbdf0,76024bbe62,;"Сброс настроек отменит несохранённые изменения. Продолжить?";reset_settings_discard_pending,45,V4022eb2db,86022eb35d,;"Ayarları sıfırlamak kaydedilmemiş değişiklikleri silecek. Devam edilsin mi?";reset_settings_discard_pending,46,V40249bcde,750249bd4f,;"Скидання налаштувань скасує незбережені зміни. Продовжити?";reset_settings_discard_pending,47,V4022fa6c9,72022fa737,;"Đặt lại cài đặt sẽ huỷ các thay đổi chưa lưu. Tiếp tục?";reset_settings_discard_pending,48,V402488594,4f024885df,;"重设设置将会放弃未保存的变更。要继续吗？";reset_settings_discard_pending,49,V4024885a2,4f024885ed,;"重設設定將會放棄未儲存的變更。要繼續嗎？";media_key_routing_always,29,V401c18065,3b01c1809c,;"Always";media_key_routing_always,30,V4034ffdb1,3b034ffde8,;"دائماً";media_key_routing_always,31,V403511005,3b0351103c,;"Always";media_key_routing_always,32,V403130567,3a0313059d,;"Immer";media_key_routing_always,33,V403591c4e,3c03591c86,;"Siempre";media_key_routing_always,35,V4034d190f,3b034d1946,;"Always";media_key_routing_always,36,V403551ab3,3b03551aea,;"Always";media_key_routing_always,37,V40355dabc,3b0355daf3,;"Always";media_key_routing_always,38,V4030905d7,3b0309060e,;"Always";media_key_routing_always,39,V4034edae5,3b034edb1c,;"Always";media_key_routing_always,40,V4035117bf,3b035