es another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,37,V40360dfec,1250360e10d,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,38,V403150b07,12503150c28,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,39,V40359e015,1250359e136,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,40,V4035d1cef,125035d1e10,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,41,V4035b1b40,125035b1c61,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,42,V4035d1d28,125035d1e49,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,43,V403591c1a,12503591d3b,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,44,V4035b1d29,109035b1e2e,;"Приостанавливать другие проигрыватели\, например радио\, во время звука Android Auto\, кроме случаев с активным Bluetooth-аудиосоединением\: обычно это тот же телефон\, и его остановка отключит звук Android Auto.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,45,V403571639,1250357175a,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,46,V4035d1bd6,125035d1cf7,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,47,V4035f0b50,125035f0c71,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,48,V4035bc7f9,91035bc886,;"Android Auto 播放音频时暂停车机上的其他播放器（如收音机），但蓝牙音频连接存在时不暂停，因为通常来自同一部手机，暂停它会导致 Android Auto 自身静音。";playback_focus_mode_auto_hint,49,V4035bcb68,125035bcc89,;"Pauses another player on the headunit (for example the radio) while Android Auto audio plays\, but not while a Bluetooth audio link is connected — that link is usually the same phone\, and pausing it would stop Android Auto's own sound.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,29,V40213a37a,a80213a41e,;"Keep each issue to a single problem so it can be tracked and fixed. Open separate issues for unrelated problems.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,30,V40308eafa,9c0308eb92,;"خصص كل تقرير لمشكلة واحدة حتى يمكن تتبعها وإصلاحها. افتح تقارير منفصلة للمشكلات غير المرتبطة ببعضها.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,31,V4032103e8,be032104a2,;"Každé hlášení nechte pro jediný problém\, aby bylo možné ho sledovat a opravit. Pro nesouvisející problémy otevřete samostatná hlášení.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,32,V4033f1a5a,7a033f1ad0,;"Erstelle für jedes unzusammenhängende Problem ein separates Issue.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,33,V403290fc3,be0329107d,;"Mantén cada issue enfocado en un solo problema para que pueda rastrearse y corregirse. Abre issues separados para problemas distintos.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,34,V4032107df,ba03210895,;"Limita cada incidencia a un solo problema para poder rastrearlo y resolverlo. Abre incidencias separadas para problemas distintos.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,35,V4030704bd,d903070592,;"Minden hibajegy egyetlen problémáról szóljon\, hogy könnyen nyomon követhető és javítható legyen. Egymással össze nem függő problémákhoz nyiss külön hibajegyeket.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,36,V4030b0531,c8030b05f5,;"Tieni ogni segnalazione a un singolo problema\, così è più facile tracciarlo e risolverlo. Apri segnalazioni separate per problemi non correlati.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,37,V4030ec787,79030ec7fc,;"追跡・修正しやすくするために、issueは1件につき1つの問題に絞ってください。関係のない問題は別のissueを作成してください。";support_rules_oneissue_desc,38,V402bff074,cf02bff13f,;"ყოველ საკითხს ერთი პრობლემა ეძღვნება\, რათა მისი თვალყურის დევნება და გამოსწორება მარტივი იყოს. დაუკავშირებელი პრობლემებისთვის გახსენით ცალკე საკითხები.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,39,V40307c7d6,720307c844,;"추적과 수정이 쉽도록 이슈 하나에는 문제 하나만 담아주세요. 관련 없는 문제는 별도의 이슈로 열어주세요.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,40,V403210b88,be03210c42,;"Houd elk issue beperkt tot één probleem zodat het gevolgd en opgelost kan worden. Open aparte issues voor niet-gerelateerde problemen.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,41,V4032109cf,b803210a83,;"Każde zgłoszenie powinno dotyczyć jednego problemu\, żeby można go było śledzić i naprawić. Niezwiązane problemy zgłaszaj osobno.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,42,V403230b8a,cc03230c52,;"Mantenha cada issue focada em um único problema para que ele possa ser rastreado e corrigido. Abra issues separadas para problemas não relacionados.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,43,V403050178,c70305023b,;"Păstrează fiecare fir de discuție la o singură problemă\, ca să poată fi urmărită și rezolvată. Deschide fire separate pentru probleme diferite.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,44,V403210b3a,cf03210c05,;"Держите каждое обращение посвящённым одной проблеме\, чтобы её можно было отследить и исправить. Создавайте отдельные обращения для несвязанных проблем.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,45,V40305fcfa,aa0305fda0,;"Her konuyu tek bir sorunla sınırlı tutun ki takip edilip düzeltilebilsin. İlgisiz sorunlar için ayrı konular açın.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,46,V403230a7a,c703230b3d,;"Кожне звернення має стосуватися однієї проблеми\, щоб її можна було відстежити й виправити. Для непов'язаних проблем відкривайте окремі issues.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,47,V4030af0bb,a5030af15c,;"Mỗi issue chỉ nên đề cập một sự cố để dễ theo dõi và xử lý. Hãy mở issue riêng cho các sự cố không liên quan.";support_rules_oneissue_desc,48,V40323bc50,620323bcae,;"每个 Issue 请聚焦於单一问题，方便追踪和修复。不相关的问题请另开 Issue。";support_rules_oneissue_desc,49,V40323bc61,620323bcbf,;"每個 Issue 請聚焦於單一問題，方便追蹤和修復。不相關的問題請另開 Issue。";onb_display_dpi_label,29,V400982a48,4300982a87,;"Android Auto size";onb_display_dpi_label,30,V402c9d0ed,4202c9d12b,;"حجم Android Auto";onb_display_dpi_label,31,V402c7df3c,4702c7df7f,;"Velikost Android Auto";onb_display_dpi_label,32,V402d1ea2d,4402d1ea6d,;"Android Auto Größe";onb_display_dpi_label,33,V402d2e9b1,4802d2e9f5,;"Tamaño de Android Auto";onb_display_dpi_label,34,V402c6e11d,4802c6e161,;"Tamaño de Android Auto";onb_display_dpi_label,35,V402c6e735,4402c6e775,;"Android 