spot network interface";hotspot_interface_override,42,V4036f2c2b,50036f2c77,;"Hotspot network interface";hotspot_interface_override,43,V4036b2b1d,50036b2b69,;"Hotspot network interface";hotspot_interface_override,44,V4036d2aa3,56036d2af5,;"Сетевой интерфейс точки доступа";hotspot_interface_override,45,V40369253c,5003692588,;"Hotspot network interface";hotspot_interface_override,46,V4036f2ad9,50036f2b25,;"Hotspot network interface";hotspot_interface_override,47,V403711a53,5003711a9f,;"Hotspot network interface";hotspot_interface_override,48,V4036dcfdd,3d036dd016,;"热点网络接口";hotspot_interface_override,49,V4036dda6b,50036ddab7,;"Hotspot network interface";overlay_permission_description,29,V4017a6b80,cb017a6c47,;"To allow Open Headunit to open automatically when Bluetooth connects\, please enable the Display over other appspermission in the next screen.";overlay_permission_description,30,V400b42f97,b700b4304a,;"للسماح لـ Open Headunit بالفتح التلقائي عند اتصال البلوتوث، يرجى تفعيل إذن \"العرض فوق التطبيقات الأخرى\" في الشاشة التالية.";overlay_permission_description,31,V400b43332,c900b433f7,;"Pro automatické otevření Open Headunit při připojení Bluetooth povolte prosím oprávnění \"Zobrazit přes ostatní aplikace\" na další obrazovce.";overlay_permission_description,32,V400cd3ce6,e100cd3dc3,;"Damit Open Headunit automatisch starten kann\, wenn Bluetooth verbindet\, aktivieren Sie bitte die Berechtigung \"Über anderen Apps einblenden\" im nächsten Bildschirm.";overlay_permission_description,33,V400b435d1,e200b436af,;"Para permitir que Open Headunit se abra automáticamente cuando se conecta Bluetooth\, habilite el permiso \"Mostrar sobre otras aplicaciones\" en la siguiente pantalla.";overlay_permission_description,34,V400ad32c5,a000ad3361,;"Para permitir que Open Headunit se abra automáticamente\, active \"Mostrar sobre otras aplicaciones\".";overlay_permission_description,35,V400b33521,e300b33600,;"Ahhoz\, hogy a Open Headunit automatikusan megnyíljon Bluetooth-csatlakozáskor\, engedélyezd a következő képernyőn a „Megjelenítés más alkalmazások felett” jogosultságot.";overlay_permission_description,36,V400cb3ccc,e000cb3da8,;"Per consentire a Open Headunit di aprirsi automaticamente quando si connette il Bluetooth\, abilita il permesso \"Mostra sopra altre app\" nella schermata successiva.";overlay_permission_description,37,V400cb2f73,8600cb2ff5,;"Bluetooth接続時にOpen Headunitが自動的に起動するようにするには、次の画面で「他のアプリの上に表示する」権限を有効にしてください。";overlay_permission_description,38,V400cc3e77,e900cc3f5c,;"იმისათვის\, რომ Open Headunit ავტომატურად გაიხსნას Bluetooth-ის დაკავშირებისას\, გთხოვთ\, შემდეგ ეკრანზე ჩართოთ ნებართვა \"ჩვენება სხვა აპების ზემოთ\" (Display over other apps).";overlay_permission_description,39,V400cd30d5,8500cd3156,;"블루투스 기기가 연결될 때 Open Headunit를 자동으로 실행하려면 다음 화면에서 \"다른 앱 위에 표시\" 권한을 허용하세요.";overlay_permission_description,40,V400b3344f,e300b3352e,;"Om Open Headunit automatisch te openen wanneer Bluetooth verbinding maakt\, dient u de toestemming \"Weergeven over andere apps\" in te schakelen in het volgende scherm.";overlay_permission_description,41,V400b433c1,d500b43492,;"Aby umożliwić automatyczne otwarcie Open Headunit po połączeniu Bluetooth\, włącz uprawnienie \"Wyświetlanie nad innymi aplikacjami\" na następnym ekranie.";overlay_permission_description,42,V400b4348c,cc00b43554,;"Para permitir que o Open Headunit abra automaticamente quando o Bluetooth conectar\, ative a permissão \"Sobrepor a outros apps\" na próxima tela.";overlay_permission_description,43,V400c73a7c,d600c73b4e,;"Pentru a lăsa Open Headunit să se deschidă automat la conectarea Bluetooth-ului\, activează permisiunea \"Afișare peste alte aplicații\" în ecranul următor.";overlay_permission_description,44,V400b4341f,d800b434f3,;"Чтобы Open Headunit мог автоматически открываться при подключении Bluetooth\, включите разрешение \"Показывать поверх других приложений\" на следующем экране.";overlay_permission_description,45,V400c83a44,ee00c83b2e,;"Bluetooth bağlandığında Open Headunit'ın otomatik olarak açılmasına izin vermek için lütfen bir sonraki ekranda \"Diğer uygulamaların üzerinde görüntüleme\" iznini etkinleştirin.";overlay_permission_description,46,V400b4342e,cf00b434f9,;"Щоб Open Headunit міг автоматично відкриватися при підключенні Bluetooth\, увімкніть дозвіл \"Показувати поверх інших програм\" на наступному екрані.";overlay_permission_description,47,V400c235de,b400c2368e,;"Để Open Headunit mở tự động khi Bluetooth kết nối\, vui lòng bật quyền \"Hiển thị trên ứng dụng khác\" ở màn hình kế tiếp.";overlay_permission_description,48,V400b3263b,7200b326a9,;"为了让 Open Headunit 在蓝牙连接时自动打开，请在下一个画面激活「显示在其他应用程序上层」的权限。";overlay_permission_description,49,V400b32643,7200b326b1,;"為了讓 Open Headunit 在藍牙連接時自動開啟，請在下一個畫面啟用「顯示在其他應用程式上層」的權限。";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,29,V4005a198d,11d005a1aa6,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,30,V40326f597,e50326f678,;"اختيار علامة سيارة حقيقية يعرض شعارها على زر الخروج في Android Auto، لكنه يخفي التطبيقات المثبتة من خارج Play Store. أبقِ Google أو Open Headunit إذا كنت تستخدم تلك التطبيقات.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,31,V4032907c2,11d032908db,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,32,V403572825,1290357294a,;"Die Auswahl einer echten Automarke zeigt deren Logo auf dem Beenden-Button von Android Auto. Android Auto blendet dann jedoch Apps aus\, die nicht aus dem Play Store stammen. Behalte \"Google\" oder \"Open Headunit\"\, wenn du solche Apps nutzt.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,33,V4033113ed,f2033114db,;"Elegir una marca de coche muestra su logotipo en el botón de salida de Android Auto\, pero oculta las aplicaciones instaladas fuera de Play Store. Mantén Google u Open Headunit si las usas.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,35,V403251076,11d0325118f,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,36,V4032b121a,11d032b1333,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,37,V4032cd223,11d032cd33c,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,38,V402e0fd3e,11d02e0fe57,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,39,V40328d370,11d0328d489,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,40,V403290f7c,11d03291095,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,41,V403290dcd,11d03290ee6,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,42,V4032b0fb5,11d032b10ce,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,43,V403250e51,11d03250f6a,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,44,V403290f37,ff03291032,;"Выбор марки автомобиля показывает её логотип на кнопке выхода Android Auto\, но скрывает приложения\, установленные не из Play Store. Оставьте Google или Open Headunit\, если используете такие приложения.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,45,V403230870,11d03230989,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,46,V4032b0e63,11d032b0f7c,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,47,V4032bfd87,11d032bfea0,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,48,V40328bde4,920328be72,;"选择真实汽车品牌会在 Android Auto 退出按钮上显示该品牌标志，但会隐藏从 Play 商店以外安装的应用。如需这些应用，请保留 Google 或 Open Headunit。";onb_vehicle_help_sideload,49,V40328bdf5,11d0328bf0e,;"Picking a real car brand also shows that brand's logo on the Android Auto exit button\, but Android Auto then stops listing apps you installed from outside the Play Store. Keep \"Google\" or \"Open Headunit\" if you use those apps.";support_rules_search_desc,29,V4020da029,f1020da116,;"First search the existing issues. If an open issue already describes your problem\, add your details as a comment there instead of opening a new one. Only open a new issue if none matches.";support_rules_search_desc,30,V40302e7d5,e70302e8b8,;"ابحث في المشكلات الموجودة أولاً. إن كانت هناك مشكلة مفتوحة تصف ما تواجهه، أضف تفاصيلك كتعليق عليها بدلاً من فتح مشكلة جديدة. لا تفتح مشكلة جديدة إلا إذا لم يكن ثمة مشكلة مطابقة.";support_rules_search_desc,31,V4031b006f,109031b0174,;"Nejprve prohledejte existující hlášení. Pokud už otevřené hlášení váš problém popisuje\, přidejte své podrobnosti jako komentář tam\, místo abyste otevírali nové. Nové hlášení otevřete\, jen pokud žádné neodpovídá.";support_rules_search_desc,32,V403391799,bd03391852,;"Durchsuche zuerst bestehende Issues. Wenn dein Problem bereits existiert\, ergänze dort einen Kommentar statt ein neues Issue zu öffnen.";support_rules_search_desc,33,V403230c3d,ff03230d38,;"Busca primero en los issues existentes. Si ya hay uno abierto que describe tu problema\, añade ahí tus detalles como comentario en lugar de abrir uno nuevo. Solo abre un issue nuevo si ninguno coincide.";support_rules_search_desc,34,V4031b0444,107031b0547,;"Busca primero entre las incidencias existentes. Si ya hay una abierta que describe tu problema\, añade tus detalles como comentario en vez de abrir una nueva. Solo abre una incidencia nueva si ninguna coincide.";support_rules_search_desc,35,V403010166,f703010259,;"Először keresd meg a meglévő hibajegyeket. Ha egy nyitott hibajegy már leírja a problémádat\, inkább ahhoz fűzz hozzászólást\, ne nyiss újat. Csak akkor nyiss új hibajegyet\, ha egyik sem egyezik.";support_rules_search_desc,36,V40305017d,129030502a2,;"Cerca prima tra le segnalazioni esistenti. Se ce n'è già una aperta che descrive il tuo problema\, aggiungi lì i tuoi dettagli come commento invece di aprirne una nuova. Apri una nuova segnalazione solo se non ne esiste nessuna corrispondente.";support_rules_search_desc,37,V40308c501,9f0308c59c,;"まず既存のissueを検索してください。同じ問題がすでに報告されていれば、新しいissueを作らずにそのissueにコメントを追加してください。一致するものがない場合にのみ、新しいissueを作成してください。";support_rules_search_desc,38,V402b9ed04,ef02b9edef,;"ჯერ მოძებნეთ არსებულ საკითხებში. თუ ღია საკითხი უკვე აღწერს თქვენს პრობლემას\, კომენტარი დაამატეთ იქ ახლის გახსნის ნაცვლად. ახალი გახსენით მხოლოდ იმ შემთხვევაში\, თუ არც ერთი არ ემთხვევა.";support_rules_search_desc,39,V40301c543,9c0301c5db,;"먼저 기존 이슈를 검색해 주세요. 같은 문제를 설명하는 열린 이슈가 있다면 새 이슈를 열지 말고 거기에 댓글로 내용을 추가해 주세요. 해당하는 이슈가 없을 때만 새 이슈를 열어주세요.";support_rules_search_desc,40,V4031b07ed,11b031b0904,;"Zoek eerst in de bestaande issues. Als er al een open issue is dat je probleem beschrijft\, voeg je je gegevens daar als reactie toe in plaats van een nieuw issue te openen. Open alleen een nieuw issue als er geen overeenkomst is.";support_rules_search_desc,41,V4031b0642,10b031b0749,;"Najpierw przeszukaj istniejące zgłoszenia. Jeśli otwarte zgłoszenie już opisuje Twój problem\, dodaj swoje szczegóły jako komentarz zamiast otwierać nowe. Otwieraj nowe zgłoszenie tylko wtedy\, gdy żadne nie pasuje.";support_rules_search_desc,42,V4031d07fc,10d031d0905,;"Primeiro pesquise nas issues existentes. Se já houver uma issue aberta descrevendo o seu problema\, adicione seus detalhes como comentário lá\, em vez de abrir uma nova. Só abra uma nova issue se nenhuma corresponder.";support_rules_search_desc,43,V402fefdd3,11902fefee8,;"Caută mai întâi în problemele existente. Dacă o problemă deschisă descrie deja situația ta\, adaugă detaliile tale acolo ca un comentariu\, în loc să deschizi una nouă. Deschide o problemă nouă doar dacă niciuna nu se potrivește.";support_rules_search_desc,44,V4031b07a8,123031b08c7,;"Сначала поищите среди существующих обращений. Если открытое обращение уже описывает вашу проблему\, добавьте свои подробности туда в виде комментария\, а не открывайте новое. Новое обращение стоит создавать только если ни одно не подходит.";support_rules_search_desc,45,V402fff99d,e702fffa80,;"Önce mevcut konuları arayın. Sorununuzu zaten açıklayan açık bir konu varsa\, yeni bir tane açmak yerine yorumunuzu oraya ekleyin. Yalnızca eşleşen konu yoksa yeni bir tane açın.";support_rules_search_desc,46,V4031d0709,fc031d0801,;"Спочатку пошукайте серед наявних issues. Якщо відкрите issue вже описує вашу проблему\, додайте свої деталі в коментар там\, а не відкривайте нове. Відкривайте нове issue лише якщо жодне не підходить.";support_rules_search_desc,47,V40304ed40,1050304ee41,;"Trước tiên hãy tìm kiếm trong các issue hiện có. Nếu đã có issue mô tả đúng sự cố của bạn\, hãy thêm thông tin của bạn làm bình luận ở đó thay vì mở issue mới. Chỉ mở issue mới nếu không có issue nào phù hợp.";support_rules_search_desc,48,V4031dba1e,82031dba9c,;"请先搜索现有的 Issue。如果已有人回报相同问题，请在那个 Issue 补充您的情况，不要另开新的。只有在找不到相符的 Issue 时，才开一个新的。";support_rules_search_desc,49,V4031dba2f,82031dbaad,;"請先搜尋現有的 Issue。如果已有人回報相同問題，請在那個 Issue 補充您的情況，不要另開新的。只有在找不到相符的 Issue 時，才開一個新的。";overlay_permission_required,29,V402c1deb0,7202c1df1e,;"Auto-start requires 'Display over other apps' permission";overlay_permission_required,30,V401936cbd,7101936d2a,;"يتطلب التشغيل التلقائي إذن 'العرض فوق التطبيقات الأخرى'";overlay_permission_required,31,V401937477,7f019374f2,;"Automatické spuštění vyžaduje oprávnění 'Zobrazit přes jiné aplikace'";overlay_permission_required,32,V401a57f2d,7d01a57fa6,;"Autostart erfordert die Berechtigung 'Über anderen Apps einblenden'";overlay_permission_required,33,V4019378f8,7d01937971,;"El inicio automático requiere el permiso 'Mostrar sobre otras apps'";overlay_permission_required,34,V4018b7258,7d018b72d1,;"El inicio automático requiere el permiso 'Mostrar sobre otras apps'";overlay_permission_required,3