s effect when dark mode is enabled";aa_desaturation_description,30,V400330d86,7300330df5,;"يتحكم في مقدار إزالة اللون. يسري فقط عند تفعيل الوضع الداكن";aa_desaturation_description,31,V400330e1a,8400330e9a,;"Určuje\, kolik barvy se odstraní. Projeví se pouze při zapnutém tmavém režimu";aa_desaturation_description,32,V400381067,84003810e7,;"Steuert\, wie viel Farbe entfernt wird. Wirkt nur bei aktiviertem Dunkelmodus";aa_desaturation_description,33,V400330ec6,8f00330f51,;"Controla cuánto color se elimina. Solo tiene efecto cuando el modo oscuro está activado";aa_desaturation_description,34,V400310e3e,8f00310ec9,;"Controla cuánto color se elimina. Solo tiene efecto cuando el modo oscuro está activado";aa_desaturation_description,35,V400330e85,9200330f13,;"Szabályozza\, mennyi szín kerüljön eltávolításra. Csak bekapcsolt sötét módban lép érvénybe";aa_desaturation_description,36,V40037105e,93003710ed,;"Controlla quanto colore viene rimosso. Ha effetto solo quando la modalità scura è abilitata";aa_desaturation_description,37,V400370ce3,5a00370d39,;"取り除く色の量を制御します。ダークモードが有効時のみに適応されます。";aa_desaturation_description,38,V400391117,880039119b,;"მართავს ფერების მოცილების ინტენსივობას. მოქმედებს მხოლოდ ბნელი რეჟიმის ჩართვისას";aa_desaturation_description,39,V400380d19,6000380d75,;"채도를 얼마나 줄일지 설정합니다. 다크 모드가 켜져 있을 때만 적용됩니다";aa_desaturation_description,40,V400320e97,9200320f25,;"Bepaalt hoeveel kleur wordt verwijderd. Werkt alleen wanneer donkere modus is ingeschakeld";aa_desaturation_description,41,V400330e40,8c00330ec8,;"Kontroluje\, ile koloru zostanie usunięte. Działa tylko przy włączonym trybie ciemnym";aa_desaturation_description,42,V400330e8b,8700330f0e,;"Controla quanta cor é removida. Só tem efeito quando o modo escuro está ativado";aa_desaturation_description,43,V400330e91,9900330f26,;"Controlează cât de multă culoare este eliminată. Are efect doar când modul întunecat este activat";aa_desaturation_description,44,V400330eae,8800330f32,;"Управляет степенью удаления цвета. Действует только при включённом тёмном режиме";aa_desaturation_description,45,V400380f82,8600381004,;"Ne kadar rengin kaldırılacağını kontrol eder. Sadece koyu mod etkinken çalışır";aa_desaturation_description,46,V400330e89,8800330f0d,;"Визначає\, скільки кольору буде видалено. Діє лише при увімкненому темному режимі";aa_desaturation_description,47,V400380f69,7c00380fe1,;"Điều chỉnh lượng màu bị loại bỏ. Chỉ áp dụng khi chế độ tối đang bật";aa_desaturation_description,48,V400320ad9,4c00320b21,;"控制移除多少色彩。仅在深色模式激活时生效";aa_desaturation_description,49,V400320ada,4c00320b22,;"控制移除多少色彩。僅在深色模式啟用時生效";setup_size_title,29,V40283c86f,390283c8a4,;"Display Size";setup_size_title,30,V401545b5a,3701545b8d,;"حجم الشاشة";setup_size_title,31,V4015461fa,3e01546234,;"Velikost displeje";setup_size_title,32,V4017a731d,3a017a7353,;"Display-Größe";setup_size_title,33,V4015465f3,3f0154662e,;"Tamaño de pantalla";setup_size_title,34,V4014d5f7d,3f014d5fb8,;"Tamaño de pantalla";setup_size_title,35,V401536573,3b015365aa,;"Kijelző mérete";setup_size_title,36,V4016b6dfe,3f016b6e39,;"Dimensioni display";setup_size_title,37,V4016b54fe,33016b552d,;"画面のサイズ";setup_size_title,38,V40190814b,3901908180,;"ეკრანის ზომა";setup_size_title,39,V4019c6471,35019c64a2,;"디스플레이 크기";setup_size_title,40,V40151635d,3a01516393,;"Schermgrootte";setup_size_title,41,V401526329,4101526366,;"Rozmiar wyświetlacza";setup_size_title,42,V40152643a,3c01526472,;"Tamanho da tela";setup_size_title,43,V40165694d,3901656982,;"Mărime ecran";setup_size_title,44,V4015563f1,3b01556428,;"Размер дисплея";setup_size_title,45,V401636992,39016369c7,;"Ekran Boyutu";setup_size_title,46,V40152631b,3b01526352,;"Розмір дисплея";setup_size_title,47,V4016d6766,40016d67a2,;"Kích thước màn hình";setup_size_title,48,V4015147db,3101514808,;"屏幕尺寸";setup_size_title,49,V4015147e5,3101514812,;"螢幕尺寸";show_navigation_notifications_description,29,V40293cc92,930293cd21,;"Show \"In X meters do Y\" and current street in notifications (for debugging)";show_navigation_