 телефон».";setup_hotspot_instructions,48,V40381d678,8b0381d6ff,;"在车辆设置中打开热点，如支持则选择 5 GHz。准确复制名称和密码，连接时保持热点开启。无需在手机上手动加入热点；点击连接手机后，DiAuto 会通过蓝牙发送连接信息。";about,29,V401ef930b,3501ef933c,;"About & Support";about,30,V401034503,3101034530,;"حول & الدعم";about,31,V401034a31,3601034a63,;"O aplikaci a podpora";about,32,V401295b01,3401295b31,;"Über & Support";about,33,V401034d8b,3901034dc0,;"Acerca de & Soporte";about,34,V400fc4938,2b00fc495f,;"Acerca de";about,35,V401024c80,3801024cb4,;"Rólunk & támogatás";about,36,V4011a555b,39011a5590,;"Informazioni e Supporto";about,37,V4011a41a7,2a011a41cd,;"アプリとサポート";about,38,V401255cc7,3a01255cfd,;"შესახებ & მხარდაჭერა";about,39,V4012f487d,29012f48a2,;"정보 및 지원";about,40,V401024bc5,3401024bf5,;"Over & Support";about,41,V401034b7c,3801034bb0,;"O aplikacji i Wsparcie";about,42,V401034c67,3501034c98,;"Sobre & Suporte";about,43,V4011651e5,3501165216,;"Despre & Suport";about,44,V401064c7c,3501064cad,;"Справка и поддержка";about,45,V401145180,37011451b3,;"Hakkında & Destek";about,46,V401034b8b,3c01034bc3,;"Про застосунок і підтримка";about,47,V4011c504f,39011c5084,;"Giới thiệu & Hỗ trợ";about,48,V401023690,2d010236b9,;"关于 & 支持";about,49,V40102369a,2d010236c3,;"關於 & 支援";setup_wifi_direct_hint,29,V403d9467a,8603d946fc,;"Alternative setup · Requires the car’s Wi-Fi switch on. A 2.4 GHz link may stutter.";setup_wifi_direct_hint,30,V4037f17fd,81037f187a,;"خيار بديل · يتطلب تشغيل Wi-Fi في السيارة. قد يتقطع الاتصال بتردد 2.4 غيغاهرتز.";setup_wifi_direct_hint,33,V4038939c7,9203893a55,;"Alternativa · Requiere activar el Wi-Fi del coche. Una conexión de 2\,4 GHz puede entrecortarse.";setup_wifi_direct_hint,44,V4037f34a6,86037f3528,;"Другой вариант · Включите Wi-Fi автомобиля. На частоте 2\,4 ГГц возможны прерывания.";setup_wifi_direct_hint,48,V4037fd5df,59037fd634,;"备选方式 · 需要打开车辆 Wi-Fi 开关。2.4 GHz 连接可能卡顿。";wireless_mode_native,29,V4030aff5f,37030aff92,;"Native";wireless_mode_native,30,V401d4882b,3e01d48865,;"أصلي (Native)";wireless_mode_native,31,V401d4